{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:18OptiViewAdsRuntime15AVPlayerAdapterC15playImmediatelyyyF","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"role":"symbol","title":"playImmediately()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/playImmediately()"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Start playback WITHOUT AVPlayer’s stall-minimization hold.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play()"},{"type":"text","text":" respects "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"automaticallyWaitsToMinimizeStalling"},{"type":"text","text":": the player keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rate at 0 while it re-evaluates whether playback can keep up, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~half a second of frozen frame even on an item whose buffer is already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full. That re-evaluation buys nothing on a pre-warmed handoff — the item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was buffered on the warm-up player precisely so it can start instantly —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the renderer uses this for warmed items only; cold loads keep "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its stall protection."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol surface since the live resume needs it too: that path corrects content’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position repeatedly behind the ad, and the hold re-engages on every correction, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what costs half a second once costs a second per correction there."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/playimmediately()"]}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/AVPlayerAdapter/playImmediately()":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"playImmediately()","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/playImmediately()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playImmediately","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/playimmediately()","abstract":[{"text":"Start playback WITHOUT AVPlayer’s stall-minimization hold.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/AVPlayerAdapter":{"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AVPlayerAdapter"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"AVFoundation implementation of the portable "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlayerAdapter"},{"type":"text","text":" (P5b)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter","